  "sharedModel": [
    "The outer root background propagates to the image canvas, outside element opacity and visibility. Resolved color/alpha values survive preparation without retaining style strings. Non-root background values remain nonapplicable where styles are otherwise admitted.",
    "Canvas paint uses the existing image boundary and output reservation, before SVG element commands. It is never inserted into a child SourceGraphic, glyph, pattern or filter surface. Its stored draw boundary cannot be folded into the source-group float solid-canvas analysis.",
    "Root generation in SVG image mode is independent of computed display:none. Preserve that computed value for explicitly inheriting children. Root traversal, font discovery and paint-resource preflight retain the same distinction.",
    "Background declaration priority and stylesheet storage use the existing per-property mechanism. Initial/unset/root-inherit resolve to transparent; currentColor retains its resolved source alpha. No CSS box owner, generic property dictionary, coordinate framework or per-fixture API matrix."
  ],
